{
  "version": "r0a-errors-v1",
  "rules": [
    "Public responses only use codes listed in public; unknown internal failures map to service_degraded.",
    "message is safe display text; it never echoes goal, background, title or artifact content.",
    "Worker-only database exceptions map to service_degraded on the public API and keep the raw code in internal logs."
